    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Thrill of the Chase</h2>Chase your friends through unique maps, trying to tag each other and avoid being &quot;it&quot; at all costs!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Up</h2>At the end of each round, the losers choose powers that will aid them in the future. Losing isn't so bad after all...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize</h2>Unlock a wide range of new colors and accessories, and dress to impress!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to Pick Up</h2>With only five buttons per player, anyone can pick up a controller and join in the fun!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Thrill of the Chase</h2>Chase your friends through unique maps, trying to tag each other and avoid being &quot;it&quot; at all costs!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Up</h2>At the end of each round, the losers choose powers that will aid them in the future. Losing isn't so bad after all...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize</h2>Unlock a wide range of new colors and accessories, and dress to impress!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to Pick Up</h2>With only five buttons per player, anyone can pick up a controller and join in the fun!",
    "short_description": "Compete with friends in the fast-paced, 2D platformer! Chase each other through various unique maps, using quick reflexes and maneuverability to avoid being &quot;it&quot;. Collect powers along the way to help dash, freeze and teleport your way to the top!",
